WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.040
At the Pesach seder, many Jewish families
pour one extra cup and open the door.

2
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.690
The cup is for Elijah the prophet.

3
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:12.590
Jews believe he will come
first, to announce someone else.

4
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:16.030
Many Jews sing a line of
hope: though he tarry,

5
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.610
I will wait daily for his coming.

6
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.920
So who are Jews waiting for, and
what would change in the world?

7
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:27.570
In this mission, you'll trace the
word Messiah back to a horn of oil.

8
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.490
Then you'll compare
Orthodox and Reform views,

9
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.640
and weigh up how much
the belief matters today.

10
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.500
Your mission: find out who
Jews expect the Messiah to be,

11
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.840
and what would change.
